{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agent-in-pipeline-patterns","title":"Agent 嵌入流水线的触发模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/foundations/agent-in-pipeline-patterns","wordCount":1480,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-friendly-pipeline-design","title":"AI 友好的流水线设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/foundations/ai-friendly-pipeline-design","wordCount":1165,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"feedback-loop-architecture","title":"反馈闭环架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/foundations/feedback-loop-architecture","wordCount":959,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础架构\">基础架构</h1><p>本章回答一个核心问题：如何在流水线里&quot;放进&quot;一个 AI Agent，让它产生有用的效果而不是变成新的故障点。</p>\n<p>三篇文档分别对应三个层次：触发模式（agent 从哪里进入流水线）、设计原则（流水线如何输出对 agent 友好的信号）、反馈闭环（agent 的产出如何回流并被后续步骤利用）。这三层合在一起，构成 AI 原生流水线的基础骨架。</p>\n"}